! NORMALLY CLOSED SWITCHES ARE DEFINED AS SHORT LINES
! Could also be defned by setting the Switch=Yes property

New Line.Sw1    phases=3  Bus1=150rd   Bus2=149d    r1=1e-3 r0=1e-3 x1=1e-3 x0=1e-3 c1=0.000 c0=0.000 Length=0.00 switch=y
New Line.Sw2    phases=3  Bus1=13d     Bus2=152d    r1=1e-3 r0=1e-3 x1=1e-3 x0=1e-3 c1=0.000 c0=0.000 Length=0.00 switch=y
